    {
      "locale": "en",
      "page": "index",
      "path": "en/index.html",
      "author": "ai-product-lead",
      "reviewer": "ai-qa",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-23",
      "notes": "FLAGGED (ai-qa, PRD v2.5 baseline). Blocking: (1) speech/voice copy 'not to send a child's voice off the device. Speech recognition stays on the device.' is inaccurate under v2.5 (no mic, no speech recognition). Fix: 'It does not use the microphone, and it does not connect to the internet.' (CF-01, build_site.py). (2) Visible postal-address placeholder sentence; fix per CF-03 decision. (3) DRAFT banner and no effective date; at publication replace with 'Effective date: ... Last updated: ...' (CF-04). Publisher name/email exact; no IAP/Android text.",
      "review_status": "flagged",
      "needs_native_check": false,
      "self_verified": false,
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5b58976c180c7c98606577ef766fd4c75659e891f5254040d866096ebc2e71"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "page": "privacy",
      "path": "en/privacy.html",
      "author": "ai-product-lead",
      "reviewer": "ai-qa",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-23",
      "notes": "FLAGGED (ai-qa, PRD v2.5 baseline). Blocking: (1) mic/speech/audio copy in #short, #app, #not-collected, #on-device, #speech, #retention, #laws, #choices: remove; app has no microphone or speech recognition (CF-05..09, 11..13). (2) #network says packs are Apple-hosted and downloaded and an on-device speech model may download; v2.5 E8-v25a: content bundled, zero network calls. Fix: 'All lessons, pictures and audio are built into the app. The app does not connect to the internet...' (CF-10). (3) {{POSTAL_ADDRESS_IF_REQUIRED}} + TODO, 'Telephone: Not published', COPPA 'postal address and telephone number are not finished': needs Gabriel/counsel decision, COPPA 312.4(d)(1) (CF-03, CF-17). (4) Draft text: DRAFT banner, no effective date, 'does not name a company... unresolved', site host 'intended, later' (CF-04, 15, 16). Should-fix: add parent-area language en/ja + daily play-time limit to #on-device settings (CF-08); replace diagnostics open question with 'Data Not Collected' (CF-14); 'child-facing side ... third-party code' -> 'no third-party SDKs' (CF-36); CCPA 'sell or share' wording (CF-37).",
      "review_status": "flagged",
      "needs_native_check": false,
      "self_verified": false,
      "source_hash": "sha256:280a8907ce28a03c7c2121fae369ddafa6f05183a5d62afdb1f4b34f4b85d1e1"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "page": "children",
      "path": "en/children.html",
      "author": "ai-product-lead",
      "reviewer": "ai-qa",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-23",
      "notes": "FLAGGED (ai-qa, PRD v2.5 baseline). Blocking: (1) #speech 'Microphone' section, 'speaking attempts', 'refuse the microphone', audio/transcript retention bullets: remove; no mic under v2.5 (CF-19..22). (2) COPPA operator contact incomplete: postal address/telephone placeholder and 'not finished... cannot be published as final' (CF-03, CF-23). (3) 'Please read it as a draft... not in force' + DRAFT banner, no effective date (CF-04, CF-24). Should-fix: 'A grown-up does that' implies an account -> 'There is no account. A grown-up sets up the app, behind a parental gate.' (CF-26); list daily play-time limit in stored settings (CF-20); App Store age label 'not final' -> Kids 'Ages 5 & Under' (CF-18). Passes: no third-party analytics/ads, parental gate, retention, deletion, parental rights, name/email exact.",
      "review_status": "flagged",
      "needs_native_check": false,
      "self_verified": false,
      "source_hash": "sha256:b49e64a698bcbf2c1369ca9e67e4120e263d799ba365c046807237cdab00be0d"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "page": "support",
      "path": "en/support.html",
      "author": "ai-product-lead",
      "reviewer": "ai-qa",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-23",
      "notes": "FLAGGED (ai-qa, PRD v2.5 baseline). Blocking: (1) #microphone and #speech sections + nav items: remove; no mic/speech recognition under v2.5 (CF-27); description 'understand speech and backups' -> 'understand backups' (CF-02). (2) #offline describes downloading packs from Apple, retries and download size; v2.5 content is bundled. Fix: 'Everything the app needs is built in, so it works without an internet connection from the first launch. Nothing is downloaded after installation.' (CF-28). (3) Postal placeholder + TODO + 'Telephone: Not published in this draft' (CF-03). (4) DRAFT banner, no effective date (CF-04). Passes: deletion steps, backup exclusion, email-only support, name/email exact.",
      "review_status": "flagged",
      "needs_native_check": false,
      "self_verified": false,
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d9e2446d50b9a6ab7aa9ee172c22ec8b22ac3ee962d162211668d0f298feb4"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "page": "terms",
      "path": "en/terms.html",
      "author": "ai-product-lead",
      "reviewer": "ai-qa",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-23",
      "notes": "FLAGGED (ai-qa, PRD v2.5 baseline). Blocking: (1) #the-app 'Japanese speech on the device / American English speech on the device' -> 'one teaches Japanese and one teaches American English' (CF-31). (2) #availability 'Content packs depend on Apple hosting them... download... on-device speech model' -> 'The lessons are built into the app. We do not promise that the App Store will keep offering the app or its updates.' (CF-32). (3) Governing-law TODO: Gabriel/counsel must choose (CF-34). (4) Postal placeholder in Apple item 8 (CF-03, CF-35). (5) #draft section + DRAFT banner, no effective date; also 'the Bridge Kids apps' plural (CF-04, CF-30). Should-fix: 'Apple may refund the purchase price' -> 'the purchase price, if any (the app is free)' (CF-33). Passes: Apple standard EULA terms, no IAP/subscription/Android, name/email exact.",
      "review_status": "flagged",
